    "detailed_description": "<strong>What is Overdose WW2</strong><br><br>Overdose WW2 is a story set in an alternate timeline.<br><br><u>Game Modes</u><br><br>The game comes with a single-player story mode at launch. After the game release, there will be Zombie mode and additional content to continue the Story. Additional story missions will include a plot independent of the main game.<br><br>1944 One of the paratroopers, who attacked towards Berlin, lands in a region far from his unit. Trying to reach his goal by exiting the difficult enemy zone, Er.Miles captures a few important plans of the enemy.<br>Try to deliver the information you have to the closest allied unit among the enemies on this difficult road that you set out on your own.",
